//! - `dbus-plugin-cli tree` — show full plugin tree
//! - `dbus-plugin-cli list` — list plugins
//! - `dbus-plugin-cli <plugin> <method> [ARGS...]` — call a method
//! - `dbus-plugin-cli <plugin> get <property>` — read a property
